### Bank Account Destinations Endpoints
### Base URL: http://localhost:8000

### Create Bank Account Destination for Beneficiary
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/beneficiaries/{{beneficiaryId}}/destinations
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

{
  "type": "bank_account",
  "label": "Main Checking Account",
  "account_number": "1234567890",
  "routing_number": "110000000",
  "iban": "GB82WEST12345698765432",
  "bic": "DEUTDEFF",
  "currency": "USD",
  "country": "US",
  "account_holder_name": "John Doe",
  "account_holder_type": "individual"
}

### List Destinations for Beneficiary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/beneficiaries/{{beneficiaryId}}/destinations
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### Example Response:
# [
#   {
#     "id": "destination-uuid",
#     "type": "bank_account",
#     "label": "Main Checking Account",
#     "last4": "7890",
#     "currency": "USD",
#     "country": "US",
#     "status": "active",
#     "created_at": "2025-01-11T10:00:00Z"
#   }
# ]

### Variables (set these in your environment or replace manually):
# @beneficiaryId = beneficiary-uuid-here
